# Taris, the escape (K1, tar_m03ae Javyar's cantina, tar_m08aa Davik's
# estate, the Ebon Hawk): the codes to Canderous, the estate, the pilot
# Hudrow's codes, the hangar's security, Davik and Calo, away to
# Dantooine. Starts from the Sith base's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough k1 @sith_base_out data/routes/k1/taris_escape.route --god
#
# The Ebon Hawk's turrets are played (m12ab, a minigame, `turrets`): the
# last fighter's death script takes the party on to the Ebon Hawk.
exit tar02_lowdoor       # the elevator down (the papers shown to its guard)
exit tar03_javydoor      # Javyar's cantina
party 1,2                # Canderous (forced) and Carth
say join up              # "Okay, let's join up..."
to tar02_candtlk         # Canderous
talk
module tar_m08aa         # Malak's order; Canderous's speeder to the estate
talk                     # Davik's tour, Calo, the guest rooms
save davik
fight 15                 # Davik's guards, come over to the party
to tar08_cagerelease     # the torture room: the droids, then the cage
fight 15                 # the cage's panel frees Hudrow only with no foe within
use tar08_cagerelease    # 15 m of it (k_ptar_hudfree), else does nothing
talk                     # Hudrow: the Ebon Hawk's codes
save hudrow
say slice the computer   # the estate's terminal: hangar security off
say access system commands
say disable hangar security
say log out
use tar08_terminala
talk
save hangar_open
to tar08_hangara         # Davik and Calo at the Ebon Hawk
talk
fight 45                 # (Calo surrenders when Davik falls: his detonator;
                         # both fall back across the hangar while they fight)
save davik_dead
gone Calo082             # Calo's body taken away: the ramp (k_ptar_ramp)
                         # speaks only then
use Ramp                 # aboard: Taris burns, the Sith fighters
talk
talk
turrets                  # m12ab: the Sith fighters, the gun manned
module ebo_m12aa         # the Ebon Hawk, on to Dantooine
talk                     # Bastila: the Council; then the landing
module danm13            # Dantooine, the Jedi Enclave's courtyard
save dantooine
